<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112958" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χᾰλαζ-ώδης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>like hail,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάγος ἀέρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.922c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>granular,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπερματα</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				582a30
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Anat.</u>
				57
			</span></i>; <i>containing granules,</i> of urinary sediment, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Coac.</u>
				569
			</span></i>; of sputum, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SD</u>
				1.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>bringing hail,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνεμοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mete.</u>
					365a1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				364b22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				6.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				1.12.18
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῴδιον</span> (viz. Aries) <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
				4.152
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χάλαζα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			) <i>pimply,</i> of the tongue, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				4.10
			</span></i>; of pigs, <i>measly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				603b16
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
